ame": "2024 HG screen 3.png", "id": "422911767473865", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974552_422911770807198_2018748843549627820_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mQRh2pfQ34wQ7kNvwEQaoYp&_nc_oc=AdmthiNSXXxwrQiMYOwNUqii2xl8qi1k5JqT6Cd41CDslBlW7wD31G0Py1sjmMxbZgo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afy8jI9AdpBBmx-t8IaSvzIBiUd8m2yvVnXz4tJ1xQJ1PQ&oe=69B56628"}, {"file_name": "2024 HG screen 4.png", "id": "1054432909633298", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974702_1054432912966631_7046083185660917993_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5gQ0HfVubz0Q7kNvwEMF3nb&_nc_oc=Adl53MsskW-XplVM-pnwejojm6pFmWu4oS76j9yCLGyJ8O5D2LnsQBMRnKvuf71yrtY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyRIi0xwdjx6Ya7xZY9xhk-FOO1yZm4p986skyT4NldcA&oe=69B56EA2"}, {"file_name": "2024 HG screen 1.png", "id": "527879776285288", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75557067_527879779618621_2727265542105493653_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=a9z9ldvZBZkQ7kNvwHidnij&_nc_oc=AdkELz22jq80x8Zx1d5tjhV3PEGOdzkLUVp3KqeH7gM1IXZkeS-FSX6hU4rpC8fWe9Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxXCceaNoqov_7KoCFc9BkwPXJmMS80sIJCVA2MN47pVg&oe=69B551E1"}, {"file_name": "2024 HG screen 2.png", "id": "3704187989892735", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982651_3704187993226068_2653672913754187359_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gpjeOyLdd6AQ7kNvwFKWVp0&_nc_oc=AdlqnAur2ija1sP-ctEp6l4rWKYrk-ge_lpLy7ICFYlitycQ4QXG1ZpW_dWa9wJlQVk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyFlwNe-EER8SrVBoQzacwKIXBRhjXNptEfqz1o8Fsmww&oe=69B56CFA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2024 HG Meta  Cover art.png", "id": "1870037076837448", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75451774_1870037080170781_4936049721755154926_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wgkqDHoQn3gQ7kNvwF3Sm13&_nc_oc=AdnIVL20_B7O6ZfhzbCn_pOnRqOlTJ5Jx62Ntwr2AjQeOAn4wJHJotQzD-GmPP84oRs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afx8xByEu-tKPoy6K7yDq1PUMdV5RzHIDxqjd3sxTzRNFQ&oe=69B54A25"}, "display_name": "Harpagun", "keywords": ["Harpagun", "VR", "FPS", "Gun"], "long_description": "Be Harpagun. Get stranded on a deserted planet. Accidentally destroy your own rocket. Be swarmed by insane critters. Wreck stuff, throw aliens. Argue with your useless crew. Smash more enemies. Meet a girl. Have hallucinations. Listen to slav beats. Shoot living grenades.\n\nThis a game. In VR. With story and stuff. Also combat. A lot of combat. It\u2019s good - you have weapons but won\u2019t use them cause it\u2019s more fun to take a washing machine and slam it into an alien\u2019s head.\n\nYou can move stuff with a gravity ray. Enemies too, just yeet them into a wall or something and they die.\n\n\nIt\u2019s an arcade game. You know, one of the ones you actually have fun playing. Like an on-rails-shooter but not really because you can move around and don\u2019t puke. Just try it, it works. If not - return to sender, spend money on other stuff.", "short_description": "Harpagun is a fast-paced VR shooter where you smash alien critters, argue with your dysfunctional crew, and destroy everything in sight. Use weapons or everyday objects with a gravity ray to wreak havoc. Built for VR, it delivers chaotic fun, immersive combat, and a wild, hilarious storyline."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://somethingrandom.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Something Random", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://somethingrandom.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_